  "description": "A box to cut out of plywood, acrylic or card with a laser and put together without glue: every face is a separate piece and the edges have fingers and notches that fit into each other, made for the thickness of your material (the sizes are the outer sizes of the box). A prism or a truncated prism on a triangle, rectangle, trapezoid or regular polygon, or a pyramid on a triangle or rectangle; on a circle or an ellipse a cylinder (straight or cut slantways), a cone or a truncated cone, with the wall closed by a comb. The picture shows which length is which.",
